{"3377450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UNFROST", "steam_appid": 3377450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/7697a148f309acd45e67c6d60b3d01ce.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/7697a148f309acd45e67c6d60b3d01ce.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/7697a148f309acd45e67c6d60b3d01ce.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/d51161129e350f6dc75f3f488169616a.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1300 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNFROST is an online co-op survival horror game set in Antarctica, where you hunt ancient entities known as the Riftborne. Gather evidence, survive extreme conditions, and prepare the only weapon capable of killing them: a correctly configured nuclear strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/b16825d43c6108473e70923c62290a93.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/b16825d43c6108473e70923c62290a93.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/b16825d43c6108473e70923c62290a93.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work as a Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate under pressure. Split tasks, mark locations, transport equipment, share evidence, and regroup before the mission falls apart. One player may investigate anomalies while another secures the perimeter or hauls critical equipment through a blizzard. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/32b5c7a7e0909648e0ab31dd22a16e8f.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/32b5c7a7e0909648e0ab31dd22a16e8f.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/32b5c7a7e0909648e0ab31dd22a16e8f.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Antarctica</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antarctica is your first enemy. Endure freezing temperatures, blizzards, and unforgiving conditions while managing warmth, supplies, and sanity. The longer your expedition lasts, the greater the pressure becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt a Living Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Riftborne isn't waiting at the end of the mission - it is hunting you from the beginning. It reacts to your actions, reshapes the battlefield, destroys parts of the environment, and forces your squad to constantly adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arm the Nuclear Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your squad understands the Riftborne's weakness, the final phase begins. Configure the correct nuclear payload, launch the strike, and extract before impact. There are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/47f6cd396c2a0dc998e1ea86924f41cb.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/47f6cd396c2a0dc998e1ea86924f41cb.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/47f6cd396c2a0dc998e1ea86924f41cb.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Expedition Is Different</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps, changing weather, dynamic lighting, randomized objectives, unique clue combinations, and evolving Riftborne behaviors ensure that no two missions play the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition moves your squad forward - even unsuccessful ones. Extract with valuable evidence, resources, and experience to unlock new equipment, improve your loadouts, and prepare for even deadlier operations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/4c82f8730bcc8025815b0606f6d06f0b.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/4c82f8730bcc8025815b0606f6d06f0b.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/4c82f8730bcc8025815b0606f6d06f0b.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/7697a148f309acd45e67c6d60b3d01ce.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/7697a148f309acd45e67c6d60b3d01ce.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/7697a148f309acd45e67c6d60b3d01ce.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/d51161129e350f6dc75f3f488169616a.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1300 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNFROST is an online co-op survival horror game set in Antarctica, where you hunt ancient entities known as the Riftborne. Gather evidence, survive extreme conditions, and prepare the only weapon capable of killing them: a correctly configured nuclear strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/b16825d43c6108473e70923c62290a93.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/b16825d43c6108473e70923c62290a93.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/b16825d43c6108473e70923c62290a93.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work as a Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate under pressure. Split tasks, mark locations, transport equipment, share evidence, and regroup before the mission falls apart. One player may investigate anomalies while another secures the perimeter or hauls critical equipment through a blizzard. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/32b5c7a7e0909648e0ab31dd22a16e8f.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/32b5c7a7e0909648e0ab31dd22a16e8f.webm?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/32b5c7a7e0909648e0ab31dd22a16e8f.mp4?t=1785538151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Antarctica</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antarctica is your first enemy. Endure freezing temperatures, blizzards, and unforgiving conditions while managing warmth, supplies, and sanity. The longer your expedition lasts, the greater the pressure becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt a Living Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Riftborne isn't waiting at the end of the mission - it is hunting you from the beginning. It reacts to your actions, reshapes the battlefield, destroys parts of the environment, and forces your squad to constantly adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arm the Nuclear Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your squad understands the Riftborne's weakness, the final phase begins. Configure the correct nuclear payload, launch the strike, and extract before impact. There are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377450/extras/47f6cd396c2a0dc998e1ea86924f41cb.poster.avif?t=1785538151\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste